{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog","id":1103498,"title":"My CofD Blog!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-14T08:10:22-07:00","id":1103498,"title":"My CofD Blog!","content":"So after thinking about it a lot, I have decided to start a blog dedicated to the CofD! I plan on using that blog in order to detail thoughts, musings, setting analysis and all other kinds of things related to the CofD, including potential adapting of elements from other games (like to WoD or Exalted) to the setting. This would mostly be a brainstorming/musing/world building/fluff developing kind of blog, with any idea which would become stable enough would be adapted and posted in the forums with any detailed mechanics it may require. I plan on posting at least weekly- maybe more, depends on how much time I'll have. Anyway, you are all invited to check it out, comment, criticize or simply read for your own enjoyment!<br /> <br /> you can find the blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> <br /> hope you'll like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","ava