lue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, wait, are these dreaming things representing a future project related to Changeling: The Dreaming?</div> </div> </div> </div>Some sort- they represent my thoughts about incorporating elements from CWoD in general (C:tD, in that case) to the cosmology. If I'll ever do such translation is something yet unknown.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T11:18:47-07:00","id":1206956,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1206856#post1206856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Loki is meant to represent an abyssal-vampire-promethean-undead kind of thing, some sort of a reanimated being powered by the cold flames of the Abyss instead of the Divine Fire or the powers of Vitae. Still at concept level, of course.<br /> <br /> It also reminds me I should have made a reference to the Prince of 100000 Leaves. I'll add it to the post. Anyway, here is the least of the realms and powers they host-<br /> <br /> <b><u>Powers</u></b><br /> Or Ein Soph, the Unomved Mover, Patron of Saints, Ruler upon the Empyrean<br /> <br /> Ahura Mazda, the Principle, Patron of Nephilim, Ruler upon the Furnace<br /> Prometheus, the Demiurge, Patron of Prometheans, Resident of the Furnace<br /> Elpis, the New Dawn, Patron of the Redeemed, Resident of the Furnace<br /> Pandora, the Mockery, Patron of Pandorans, Resident of the Furnace<br /> Metatron, the Golden Cage, Patron of Alchemists, Resident of the Furnace<br /> Iblis, the Burning Ember, Patron of Shaytan, Resident of the Furnace<br /> <br /> Djehuty, the Scroll of Heaven, Patron of the Visitors, Ruler upon A'aru<br /> Sodpet, the Roaming Star, Patron of the Deceived, Resident of A'aru<br /> Sutekh, the Nameless Serpent, Patron of the Cabiri, Ruler upon the Bridge of Will<br /> <br /> Sophia, the Oracle of Wisdom, Patron of Mages, Ruler upon the Supernal<br /> Ahriman, the Lie of Kings, Patron of the Seers, Ruler upon the Lie<br /> Azrael, the Broken Truth, Patron of Banishers, Resident of the Supernal<br /> Ananke, the Weaver of Patterns, Patron of the Ananke, Resident of the Supernal<br /> Ryujin, the Blood of the Dragon, Patron of Proximi, Resident of the Supernal<br /> <br /> Hecate, the Gatekeeper, Patron of the Promethean Brotherhood, Ruler upon the Gate<br /> Ialdabaoth, the Void, Patron of Scelesti, Ruler upon the Abyss<br /> Enshu, the Puppetmaster, Patron of Headhunters, Resident of the Abyss<br /> Hermes, the Opener of Paths, Patron of Conjurers, Resident of the Abyss<br /> Mahakala, the Shattered, Patron of Outlaws, Resident of the Abyss<br /> Nidhogg, the Father, Patron of the Tremere, Ruler upon Yggdrasil<br /> Mania, the Inspiring Madness, Patron of Geniuses, Ruler upon the Bardo<br /> Abaddon, the Gnawing Sloth, Patron of Clockstoppers, Resident of the Bardo<br /> Itzpapalotl, the Obsidian Butterfly, Patron of the Nemontemi, Resident of the Abyss<br /> Khonsu, the Blasphemous Scribe, Patron of the Wendigo, Resident of the Abyss<br /> Loki, the Tricking Flame, Patron of the Reanimated, Resident of the Abyss<br /> <br /> Python, the Serpent, Patron of Psychics, Ruler upon the Astral<br /> Naamah, the Queen of Succubi, Patron of the Lidrec, Ruler upon the Purgatory<br /> Bast, the King of Cats, Patron of the Colony, Ruler upon Ulthar<br /> <br /> Sedna, the Dark Mother, Patron of Beasts, Ruler upon the Primordial Dream<br /> Behemoth, the Primogenitor, Patron of the Insatiable, Resident of the Primordial Dream<br /> Heracles, the Slayer, Patron of Heroes, Ruler upon the Wall of Language<br /> Perun, the Icon of Faith, Patron of the Zmajeviti, Resident of the Primordial Dream<br /> Yam, the Hungry Greed, Patron of Yam VeNahar, Resident of the Primordial Dream<br /> Daucina, the Fool, Patron of the Void Seekers, Resident of the Primordial Dream<br /> Guabancex, the Secret Eater, Patron of the Nightmare Network, Resident of the Primordial Dream<br /> Varayogini, the Freedom of Passion, Patron of the Bodhisattvas, Ruler upon the Temple<br /> <br /> Danu, the Mother of Dreams, Patron of the Tuatha, Ruler upon the Dreaming<br /> Erlking, the Devil of the Mists, Patron of the Thallain, Resident of the Dreaming<br /> Balor, the Evil Eye, Patron of the Adhene, Resident of the Dreaming<br /> Galatea, the Living Statue, Patron of the Inanimae, Resident of the Dreaming<br /> Nabu, the Banal Scribe, Patron of the Duantain, Ruler upon the Gap of Reason<br /> <br /> Amaterasu, the Radiant Hope, Patron of Princesses, Ruler upon the Kingdom of Hope<br /> Itztlacoliuhqui, the Frozen Night, Patron of the Dethroned, Resident of the Kingdom of Hope<br /> Tsukuyomi, the Warden of Dreams, Patron of Wardens, Resident of the Kingdom of Hope<br /> Susanoo, the Raging Storm, Patron of the Stormwrecked, Ruler upon the Storm<br /> <br /> Thalassa, the Song, Patron of Sirens, Ruler upon the Celestial Ocean<br /> Cybele, the Wrathful Land, Patron of Land Furies, Resident of the Celestial Ocean<br /> Rahab, the Sea, Patron of the Deep Ones, Resident of the Celestial Ocean<br /> Kur, the Dragon Emperor, Patron of the Ororboroi, Ruler upon the Monarchy<br /> <br /> Pasithea, the Dream Merchant, Patron of Cambions, Ruler upon the Skein</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you Lost. What are the Shaytan? Are they the Lilith in from Promethean?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T11:20:53-07:00","id":1206957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1206956#post1206956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you Lost. What are the Shaytan? Are they the Lilith in from Promethean?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope- they are a rough concept for a &quot;fallen qashmalim&quot;. Not exactly fallen, as qashmalim can't fall- but something along those lines. Think about them as serving the Principle, by not serving the Principle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T12:48:00-07:00","id":1207376,"title":"","content":"Also,were the dur-abzu created by Ialdaboth or did they arise naturally?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T13:30:55-07:00","id":1207392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1207376#post1207376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also,were the dur-abzu created by Ialdaboth or did they arise naturally?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Ialdaboth does not create, but he is responsible for their creation. They are his children, in a sense, as much as the Oracles are the children of Sophia, and the Exarchs are the children of Ahriman.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T13:37:47-07:00","id":1207393,"title":"","content":"Any explanation in this cosmology for why Sophia's children have Obsessions or can gain Mana from blood sacrifice as a template-wide ability?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T13:38:42-07:00","id":1207394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1207392#post1207392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, Ialdaboth does not create, but he is responsible for their creation. They are his children, in a sense, as much as the Oracles are the children of Sophia, and the Exarchs are the children of Ahriman.</div> </div> </div> </div>If the Exarchs are the children Of Ahriman does it mean they weren't originally human?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T13:39:31-07:00","id":1207395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <di