lue":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T11:48:21-07:00","id":1208091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1207766#post1207766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If sophia managed to beat or destroy Ahriman,would She (i'm assuming female pronouns can be used?) let the material world to it's own devices or would she try to change it?</div> </div> </div> </div>If Sophia were free, the world won't be Fallen anymore- it would be Atlantis, once more. And as Atlantis, it would be a place of wonders and terrors, of wisdom and hubris. And as Atlantis, the hubris of humanity would rise and shatter the world, and Ahriman would once more bind Sophia, written his Lie upon the Truth. It happened countless times before. It would happen again. It happening right now, you are just not aware of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T13:17:24-07:00","id":1208132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1208091#post1208091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Sophia were free, the world won't be Fallen anymore- it would be Atlantis, once more. And as Atlantis, it would be a place of wonders and terrors, of wisdom and hubris. And as Atlantis, the hubris of humanity would rise and shatter the world, and Ahriman would once more bind Sophia, written his Lie upon the Truth. It happened countless times before. It would happen again. It happening right now, you are just not aware of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>y'kow,there are many different interpretation of Atlantis,but i think this one takes the cake for me","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T14:50:36-07:00","id":1208584,"title":"","content":"Does Ahura Mazda Wants the divine fire to be used to create prometheans,or is it being stolen by the Prometheus and the demiurges after him?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T14:55:53-07:00","id":1208587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1208584#post1208584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does Ahura Mazda Wants the divine fire to be used to create prometheans,or is it being stolen by the Prometheus and the demiurges after him?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahura Mazda wants to change the world. Prometheus allows it to happen by summoning the fire to earth- but the act itself is still against the Principle's nature, for it creates something which is imperfect and yeah, Prometheus did stole the Fire to do so. The fact that the Principle appreciate the chance it has at transforming the Prometheans into humans does not mean it does not condemn Prometheus for doing so. It may sound hypocrite, but it is simply his nature- things must change, the Fire must spread, and lead must turn to gold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T15:11:34-07:00","id":1208595,"title":"","content":"What are your views in the dark mother claim to be the mother of all mosnters?<br /> In my own view of things,the Dark Mother is indeed the mother,in a sense. She is the the idea of monsters,so anyone who does monstrous things,who creates fear in people even if it's unintentional. by their very nature are family. For instance:<br /> Sedna didn't literally gave birth to father wolf,but every time a werewolf shows his teeth to someone and that person is scared,the fear connects the werewolf to sedna. That happens when vampires show their fangs,or when prometheans hurt people in the throes of torment. All of those guys have their own progenitors,but Sedna is also their mother because she is the idea of a monster,making all monsters connected to her in a bond that may be called familiar. Do you agree,or do you see things differently?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 04-18-2018, 06:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T15:19:04-07:00","id":1208597,"title":"","content":"Sorry,the first message went incompleted","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T02:38:05-07:00","id":1208778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1208595#post1208595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What are your views in the dark mother claim to be the mother of all mosnters?<br /> In my own view of things,the Dark Mother is indeed the mother,in a sense. She is the the idea of monsters,so anyone who does monstrous things,who creates fear in people even if it's unintentional. by their very nature are family. For instance:<br /> Sedna didn't literally gave birth to father wolf,but every time a werewolf shows his teeth to someone and that person is scared,the fear connects the werewolf to sedna. That happens when vampires show their fangs,or when prometheans hurt people in the throes of torment. All of those guys have their own progenitors,but Sedna is also their mother because she is the idea of a monster,making all monsters connected to her in a bond that may be called familiar. Do you agree,or do you see things differently?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>yeah, that's what I more or less also have in mind- Sedna is the incarnation of the fear from monsters. She is the ideal monster, and as such she is the mother of all other monsters. The other powers may disagree about the exact details, but they can't deny that she is, in a way, their kin- whether they like it or not. In fact, I won't be surprised to discover that Sedna is in fact the reason the whole multiverse has not yet turned into a bloody civil war until now :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T08:56:30-07:00","id":1208901,"title":"","content":"And here is the second part of my <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/04/19/chapter-24-dancing-in-the-middle-cosmology-and-powers-pt-2/\" target=\"_blank\">cosmology</a>. The third (and hopefully, finale) part of it would be posted next week. En