fall of the Great Predator did for Pangaea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Does he have a Bane?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T11:53:58-07:00","id":1209340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1209329#post1209329\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Does he have a Bane?</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course! All gods have their weaknesses, after all :P<br /> <br /> (don't ask me what the bane may be, as I have no idea. Probably something &quot;purifying&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T13:08:36-07:00","id":1209363,"title":"","content":"what are the underfolk? And how the Consensus and the Supernal co-exist?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 04-20-2018, 04:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T13:30:29-07:00","id":1209374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1209363#post1209363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what are the underfolk? And how the Consensus and the Supernal co-exist?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Underfolk are a concept I have for an underground civilizations which lurk beneath the surface, kidnapping surface dwellers and worshiping defile powers. Still at a rough subject stage, of course, but I do like the concept. Something between the Time Machine's Morlocks and D&amp;D's Drow and other Underdark races.<br /> <br /> As detailed in the cosmology thread, the Consensus is based upon Malkhut's natural ley lines, generated from the pieces of Ptah which cling to the souls of future Speakers (or mages). Metaphysically, &quot;Consensusal&quot; magic work on similar principles as Supernal magic- in both cases, the Fallen is an &quot;illusion&quot;, or a Lie, but where the Awakened manipulate the very principles upon which reality is built, the Speakers draw upon reality's fluid nature in order to change it. Something like two different program languages, only where the Supernal being Binary Code (or C at best) while the Consensus being Python (and in that metaphor, Witches would be users instead of programmers, who work with the already built access for magic found in the Fallen). If you read the Death Gate Cycle, think about the Awakened as Sartan and the Speakers as Patryns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T13:36:33-07:00","id":1209377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1209374#post1209374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Underfolk are a concept I have for an underground civilizations which lurk beneath the surface, kidnapping surface dwellers and worshiping defile powers. Still at a rough subject stage, of course, but I do like the concept. Something between the Time Machine's Morlocks and D&amp;D's Drow and other Underdark races.<br /> <br /> As detailed in the cosmology thread, the Consensus is based upon Malkhut's natural ley lines, generated from the pieces of Ptah which cling to the souls of future Speakers (or mages). Metaphysically, &amp;quot;Consensusal&amp;quot; magic work on similar principles as Supernal magic- in both cases, the Fallen is an &amp;quot;illusion&amp;quot;, or a Lie, but where the Awakened manipulate the very principles upon which reality is built, the Speakers draw upon reality's fluid nature in order to change it. Something like two different program languages, only where the Supernal being Binary Code (or C at best) while the Consensus being Python (and in that metaphor, Witches would be users instead of programmers, who work with the already built access for magic found in the Fallen). If you read the Death Gate Cycle, think about the Awakened as Sartan and the Speakers as Patryns.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah okay. Sorry If I'm asking things that are already explained. I'm not that good at english","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/co