"content":"Hmmm. What are the dreaming relationship with Faerie and it's inhabitants in this version of the World?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T00:36:31-07:00","id":1209538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1209498#post1209498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm. What are the dreaming relationship with Faerie and it's inhabitants in this version of the World?</div> </div> </div> </div>little to none. The Lost would probably be suspicious of the Tuatha, believing they are probably connected to the Gentry in one way or another. The Tuatha would deny any connection, and would think that the Gentry must be Fomorians or some other kind of Fae exiled from the Dreaming. Some may theorize that perhaps the Gentry are a form of Tuatha who instead of reincarnating into mortal bodies, have survived by leeching the creativity and souls out of mortals instead. But metaphysically speaking, the Dreaming and the Wyrd would look each other at the same awe as the one scientists has when they look upon the eye of a squid- how two such different paths have gained such similar results?","signature":"<hr c