roll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who are the Old Ones Coatlicue is the patron of? And is the Mnesis a place that can be visited? Can beings from there be summoned?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've detailed the Old Ones in my homebrew sig- they are based around a concept mentioned in Changing Breeds, and are meant to serve as their &quot;chronicle antagonists&quot;. The Mnesis is not a place that could visit as much as it is a place that visits you- when the bones of the Old Ones are devoured and their memories awaken, they force that remembered world upon reality, manifesting the Mnesis upon the surroundings, flora, fauna and even humans, supernaturals and beings of ephemra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-15T13:22:17-07:00","id":1219026,"title":"","content":"Are the Wyrm,Wyld and Weaver greater than Luna or Helios? They're all part of the Shadow I assume?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24222-acopiltaczet","name":"Acopiltaczet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24222_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-15T13:36:50-07:00","id":1219033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acopiltaczet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1219026#post1219026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the Wyrm,Wyld and Weaver greater than Luna or Helios? They're all part of the Shadow I assume?</div> </div> </div> </div>Define &quot;greater&quot;. The Triad in this cosmology is similar to Lovecraft's story &quot;the Other Gods&quot;. Gaea, Luna and Helios are the gods of Earth, with Gaea being the Shadow itself, while Luna and Helios representing primordial and alien powers which control the flow of spiritual Essence (Luna as the idigam, and Helios as a Void Leviathan). Inside of Earth's sphere of influence, the Triad are of equal footing to Gaea and her children, being mysterious and powerful, yet still bound by the rules of the Shadow as dictated by them. Outside of the Shadow, however, in the so called &quot;Beyond&quot;, Gaea is simply a single planet, Luna is a scrap of rock and Helios is a dying flame. There are much stranger Void spirits and shapeless entities, above which the Triad rules undisturbed- but in each such &quot;other Shadow&quot;, the Triad is bound once more. In the hierarchy of Hisil, Gaea is of Rank 10. When compared to other Shadows, however, she is nothing but a pale, blue dot, of Rank 3-5 at best (it has life, after all), while the Triad are of Rank 10.<br /> <br /> It is complicated, sure- but in this cosmology, Rank is subjective. That shard of the Wyrm you see in Earth is not the same you may see in WASP-45, for example, and while the Wyld may be loosing the war in here, it wins on the other side of the cosmos. What Gaea does is attempting to minimize the damage caused when the fundamental forces behind all Shadows wage war in her turf, which is where she has the upper hand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-15T13:42:43-07:00","id":1219039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1219033#post1219033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Define &amp;quot;greater&amp;quot;. The Triad in this cosmology is similar to Lovecraft's story &amp;quot;the Other Gods&amp;quot;. Gaea, Luna and Helios are the gods of Earth, with Gaea being the Shadow itself, while Luna and Helios representing primordial and alien powers which control the flow of spiritual Essence (Luna as the idigam, and Helios as a Void Leviathan). Inside of Earth's sphere of influence, the Triad are of equal footing to Gaea and her children, being mysterious and powerful, yet still bound by the rules of the Shadow as dictated by them. Outside of the Shadow, however, in the so called &amp;quot;Beyond&amp;quot;, Gaea is simply a single planet, Luna is a scrap of rock and Helios is a dying flame. There are much stranger Void spirits and shapeless entities, above which the Triad rules undisturbed- but in each such &amp;quot;other Shadow&amp;quot;, the Triad is bound once more. In the hierarchy of Hisil, Gaea is of Rank 10. When compared to other Shadows, however, she is nothing but a pale, blue dot, of Rank 3-5 at best (it has life, after all), while the Triad are of Rank 10.<br /> <br /> It is complicated, sure- but in this cosmology, Rank is subjective. That shard of the Wyrm you see in Earth is not the same you may see in WASP-45, for example, and while the Wyld may be loosing the war in here, it wins on the other side of the cosmos. What Gaea does is attempting to minimize the damage caused when the fundamental forces behind all Shadows wage war in her turf, which is where she has the upper hand.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I get it. Say,will there be a Lucifer somewhere in your universe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24222-acopiltaczet","name":"Acopiltaczet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24222_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-15T13:43:31-07:00","id":1219040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acopiltaczet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1219039#post1219039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think I get it. Say,will there be a Lucifer somewhere in your universe?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. I just need to find some time for the last section of the cosmology.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T10:16:08-07:00","id":1220009,"title":"","content":"And this week, I present to you my vision for <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/05/18/chapter-25-my-exalted-devil-yozi-in-the-cofd/\" target=\"_blank\">adapting the yozi</a> from Exalted into the CofD! Not as whole, of course- but each as an interesting setting material which stands on its own. I hope to make a detail writeup for each of the ideas detailed in here. While I plan on writing them by their order in the list, if there is one you are more eager to see I'll gladly write it earlier than expected <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T04:50:35-07:00","id":1221989,"title":"","content":"And here is (very) short post about some concept about<a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/05/25/chapter-28-diabolical-exaltation-yozi-in-cofd-pt-2/\" target=\"_blank\"> templates</a> based around the yozi. Hope you'll like it, and notice I may not be able to post regularly in the next few weeks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T06:30:47-07:00","id":1222008,"title":"","content":"A few days ago I was wondering if I could somehow adopt the Exalted and/or the WoD splats as foils to the major playable splats in the CofD, and now I stumble upon this. <br /> <br /> Well, looks like I\u2019ve got some reading to do...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: Read the Yozi posts. <br /> <br /> Remember how I disagreed with you about the God-Machine being a discrete, physical entity? If you make She Who Lives in Her Name the Machine\u2019s \u201cmain server\u201d so to speak, consider my full support give <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Oh, and Malfeas sounds like He could be the Primogenitor the Insatiables believe themselves descended from (although BPG says that they\u2019re still from Horrors, just not belonging fully in the Primordial Dream). Or did you already have a deity ready for them? I can\u2019t keep up tracking your pantheon. <br /> <br /> Last note, as a Mage fan, Yozis in general sound a lot like hypothetical Rank 6+ Bound.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":". 05-25-2018, 10:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T08:02:02-07:00","id":1222252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1222008#post1222008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few days ago I was wondering if I could somehow adopt the Exalted and/or the WoD splats as foils to the major playable splats in the CofD, and now I stumble upon this.<br /> <br /> Well, looks like I\u2019ve got some reading to do...</div> </div> </div> </div>well, I have a number of such ideas scattered through previous blog posts. I could sum them up for you, if you would find it helpful <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Oh, and Malfeas sounds like He could be the Primogenitor the Insatiables believe themselves descended from (although BPG says that they\u2019re still from Horrors, just not belonging fully in the Primordial Dream). Or did you already have a deity ready for them? I can\u2019t keep up tracking your pantheon. </div> </div> </div>As I'm trying to base those Powers as RL mythological figures, I've named the Primogenitor as Behemoth (Leilel was the one to suggest it in one earlier thread, actually). There is a deity sum up in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog/page11\">here</a>. Anyway, I really feel inspired into tying the Demon City to the Celebrants from the GMC, and connecting it into the Primordial Dream to give a more lovecraftian feeling to it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Last note, as a Mage fan, Yozis in general sound a lot like hypothetical Rank 6+ Bound. </div> </div> </div>The Yozi and the Infernals are my main inspiration for my Bound/Invoker template concept <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-10T12:18:53-07:00","id":1226276,"title":"","content":"Lost,are you going to finish the last part of the cosmology this week?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24222-acopiltaczet","name":"Acopiltaczet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24222_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-10T12:46:14-07:00","id":1226278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acopiltaczet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1226276#post1226276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">L