chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T01:41:18-07:00","id":1242264,"title":"","content":"And this week I'm happy to introduce you a new <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/08/03/open-development-11-ruins-of-lauresthenia-shard/\" target=\"_blank\">fantasy Shard for the CofD</a>- hope you'll like it, and please say what you think!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T03:33:43-07:00","id":1242283,"title":"","content":"Just a friendly reminder that someone\u2019s reading your stuff here, despite lack of comments. <br /> <br /> Actually, more than a reminder after reading that last post; imagine a Shard where we actually play the more fantastical Durances in Faerie. Sounds like High Fantasy to me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T07:55:10-07:00","id":1242357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1242283#post1242283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, more than a reminder after reading that last post; imagine a Shard where we actually play the more fantastical Durances in Faerie. Sounds like High Fantasy to me!</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that could actually take place in the Kingdom of Diwyn in my suggested Shard- after all, the Hedge and Arcadia are physically present in the setting as a part of the world in the form of the Aluvirian Forest. Entering the realm of the Gentry is much easier in the Shard- even though that leaving is as hard as it always been.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T14:57:47-07:00","id":1242504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1239642#post1239642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And for this week, I'm happy to present you the first (in my hopefully last and successful attempt) at <a href=\"http://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/07/28/open-development-10-calling-fourth-the-darkness-conjurer-the-shattering/&amp;quot;]Conjurer:</a> the Shattering[/URL]! Hope you'll like what you'll see, feel free to ask questions and if any of you would like to help I'll be more than happy to accept the offer :P</div> </div> </div> </div>I quite like this Lexicon.<br /> <br /> Like you said though, a Toy is not a geist; it's a fundamentally mindless entity, a white blood cell of reality that you, a Shattered, have learned how to steer differently. It has no fundamental agenda apart from removing you from the body. It's purely reactive.<br /> <br /> Which makes it sound like a perfect Vice equivalent. A Conjurer's Virtue/Life/Masque is her Pulse, what keeps her still existing despite knowing she's a target by an angry alien god. On the one hand it preserves her as an individual, on the other it guides her to ignore the effect she has on the world and gets in the way of Touchstones. Her Vice/Legend/Dirge is her Vein, which is how she deals with the guilt/hassle of being a threat and wants to rebalance the scales; it helps with both connecting to Touchstones and her humanity, but it's also the reason a Toy gives for why it wants her dead; it's the part of her that agrees with it. Rely on it too much, the Toy develops a new way to torment her by learning from what she puts into it.<br /> <br /> In fact, let's say the way a Toy wants to hurt you is represented by being it's own Aspirations-except they don't have wills of their own, but ways to break you by reflexively manipulating strings. They're not goals, they're Strategems.<br /> <br /> EDIT: In fact, that can tie into their Integrity version; a Shattered is not sane in a human way anymore, everything is a game where the stakes are existence itself. However, their status in the game is very much important to them, a measurement of both how badly they're losing to the Toymaker and how much it feels it hates them and wants them to lose personally. I suggest &quot;Position,&quot; as in &quot;this is a good/bad Position I'm in.&quot; A 0 Position Conjurer is not unplayable or (necessarily) a monster, he's in Check; the Toymaker has him backed into a corner and is pissed off enough to make him a priority. Outlaws and Headhunters are always on the lookout for these people, because they're desperate enough to accept <i>any </i>way out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 08-03-2018, 06:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T15:44:18-07:00","id":1242514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1242504#post1242504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I quite like this Lexicon.<br /> <br /> Like you said though, a Toy is not a geist; it's a fundamentally mindless entity, a white blood cell of reality that you, a Shattered, have learned how to steer differently. It has no fundamental agenda apart from removing you from the body. It's purely reactive.<br /> <br /> Which makes it sound like a perfect Vice equivalent. A Conjurer's Virtue/Life/Masque is her Pulse, what keeps her still existing despite knowing she's a target by an angry alien god. On the one hand it preserves her as an individual, on the other it guides her to ignore the effect she has on the world and gets in the way of Touchstones. Her Vice/Legend/Dirge is her Vein, which is how she deals with the guilt/hassle of being a threat and wants to rebalance the scales; it helps with both connecting to Touchstones and her humanity, but it's also the reason a Toy gives for why it wants her dead; it's the part of her that agrees with it. Rely on it too much, the Toy develops a new way to torment her by learning from what she puts into it.<br /> <br /> In fact, let's say the way a Toy wants to hurt you is represented by being it's own Aspirations-except they don't have wills of their own, but ways to break you by reflexively manipulating strings. They're not goals, they're Strategems.<br /> <br /> EDIT: In fact, that can tie into their Integrity version; a Shattered is not sane in a human way anymore, everything is a game where the stakes are existence itself. However, their status in the game is very much important to them, a measurement of both how badly they're losing to the Toymaker and how much it feels it hates them and wants them to lose personally. I suggest &quot;Position,&quot; as in &quot;this is a good/bad Position I'm in.&quot; A 0 Position Conjurer is not unplayable or (necessarily) a monster, he's in Check; the Toymaker has him backed into a corner and is pissed off enough to make him a priority. Outlaws and Headhunters are always on the lookout for these people, because they're desperate enough to accept <i>any </i>way out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ohhh those seems to be some good suggestions! Far different from what I had in mind, in fact- which is why I want to hear what other people have in mind about the subject. Other opinions are always important. I assume that the Pulse/Vein is a reference to the conjurer's Heart. Still think about Position- the original concept was Identity, which is a major theme in my concept for the game, so I'll have to think about it as I do think your suggestion is interesting. The divorce of the Mad/Draugr status (a.k.a, Wild conjurers) from the &quot;karma meter&quot; does makes sense, as it requires an active action from the side of the Shattered. If we were to use the Position method, however, how can we make sure it won't overlap too much with Cover?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T16:01:36-07:00","id":1242521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1242514#post1242514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ohhh those seems to be some good suggestions! Far different from what I had in mind, in fact- which is why I want to hear what other people have in mind about the subject. Other opinions are always important. I assume that the Pulse/Vein is a reference to the conjurer's Heart. Still think about Position- the original concept was Identity, which is a major theme in my concept for the game, so I'll have to think about it as I do think your suggestion is interesting. The divorce of the Mad/Draugr status (a.k.a, Wild conjurers) from the &quot;karma meter&quot; does makes sense, as it requires an active action from the side of the Shattered. If we were to use the Position method, however, how can we make sure it won't overlap too much with Cover?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yep, Pulse/Vein ties into a Heart; both facets of the Conjurer identity, what keeps them alive and what restrains them.<br /> <br /> For Position, the idea isn't preserving a public life by acting out who your mask is, it's making sure the Toymaker and its allies can't and don't want to force you into obeying its rules; given how important I feel Touchstones should be to the Shattered, a major way of breaking Position is putting yourself before your Touchstones, since that both drives them away emotionally and makes them easier targets (less of your strands in the way) and proves how badly you're abusing your separation from fate. Apart from that, Position is much more like playing a spirit trying to avoid Bans; you construct various &quot;house rules&quot; around yourself that the Toys have to play by, but if you break them they'll eagerly punish you for it. You can, and do, roll to regain Position (which I have a proper name for, a <i>flourish</i>) for building up new Touchstones and both from repairing fate (you become less of a priority) and by thwarting Strategems (as the Toymaker wastes moves against you and allows you to regroup).<br /> <br /> Also wondering if it should be more of a Health track, like Clarity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T03:33:29-07:00","id":1242672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1242521#post1242521\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For Position, the idea isn't preserving a public life by acting out who your mask is, it's making sure the Toymaker and its allies can't and don't want to force you into obeying its rules; given how important I feel Touchstones should be to the Shattered, a major way of breaking Position is putting yourself before your Touchstones, since that both drives them away emotionally and makes them easier targets (less of your strands in the way) and proves how badly you're abusing your separation from fate. Apart from that, Position is much more like playing a spirit trying to avoid Bans; you construct various &quot;house rules&quot; around yourself that the Toys have to play by, but if you break them they'll eagerly punish you for it. You can, and do, roll to regain Position (which I have a proper name for, a <i>flourish</i>) for building up new Touchstones and both from repairing fate (you become less of a priority) and by thwarting Strategems (as the Toymaker wastes moves against you and allows you to regroup).<br /> <br /> Also wondering if it should be more of a Health track, like Clarity.</div> </div> </div> </div>well, you definitely got the role of Touchstones in the game, I think. In fact, I plan of them being tied to the conjurer through the Marionette Syndrome directly, which means that they (meta)physically anchor the Shattered to the world, and are also one of the only methods that the Toymaker can get back at you (as you are not tied to the Syndrome, and as such can't be effected by most of its time/fate manipulation shenanigans). I think that instead of getting along with fate, it should represent how open you are for the Toymaker's influence. Being at low Position should mean that you are vulnerable to it, and as such you put your Touchstones at bigger danger. Being tied to Marionette Syndrome/fate should not be a good thing, as it gives the Toymaker a greater control over your life. Free will and choosing your own fate is what the Shattered should do- so in low Position, the Toymaker has surrounded your Touchstones with its strings and use them to harm you. At high Position, you have better control over them, and as such you can protect them from the Toymaker's moves.<br /> <br /> So in a way, if the life of the conjurer are a game, the Touchstones are the pawns upon the board- like a one colored chess, where both sides use the same tools, in order to cause each other more harm. Usually, you play on defensive- but at high Position, you can go on offensive and start working toward your own, perfect freedom- Presque Vu.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T05:33:08-07:00","id":1242689,"title":"","content":"Remember the Fate rules from when GMC was at its youngest? The \u201csticky end\u201d that characters are likely to meet, forming a third Anchor trait along with Vice and Virtue, and manipulated by the God-Machine? Would the Marionette Syndrome work like that (but with the Toymaker instead of the Machine)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T06:38:18-07:00","id":1242702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1242689#post1242689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remember the Fate rules from when GMC was at its youngest? The \u201csticky end\u201d that characters are likely to meet, forming a third Anchor trait along with Vice and Virtue, and manipulated by the God-Machine? Would the Marionette Syndrome work like that (but with the Toymaker instead of the Machine)?</div> </div> </div> </div>ammm.. actually, I haven't gave much thought to how to mechanically deal with the Syndrome other than the fact that it allows the conjurer in question to affect and influence other beings. They use its strings in order to bind Toys, create Trumps and Accessories, form Echoes, pledge allegiance to Houses, work Fluctuations and govern their Heart and Touchstones. In sort, it was always a background material which explains how the powers of the conjurers work, and how do the Toymaker manipulates the world. However, if we were to treat the Toymaker as assigning Fates to people through the Syndrome, and allowing conjurers to see and interact with those Fates (and perhaps even find a way to avoid/replace them), it could add a nice touch to the game. We just need to make sure it won't make Conjurer too complicated, as the former drafts of the game were.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T06:43:49-07:00","id":1242703,"title":"","content":"Yeah, conciseness is a virtue. Just throwing ideas around here until something sticks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Oh, wait... characters\u2019 Aspirations, by RAW, can be something their players want happening to them instead of what the characters aspire. Like \u201cFail reconnecting with my ex\u201d or something. Maybe the Toymaker can levy such Aspirations? Hmm but this gets wonky with NPCs...<br /> <br /> EDIT: Oh, and since you\u2019re here and all that; what kind of Monster is Conjurer invoking? All gamelines have one, even if in broad strokes like Beast and Deviant, or the obscure like Geist. And what non-Horror Genre(s) does it primarily invoke? Demon, for example, borrows extensively from Espionage, Conspiracy Theories, and Gnosticism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":". 08-04-2018, 09:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-05T07:48:36-07:00","id":1242943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1242703#post1242703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Oh, and since you\u2019re here and all that; what kind of Monster is Conjurer invoking? All gamelines have one, even if in broad strokes like Beast and Deviant, or the obscure like Geist. And what non-Horror Genre(s) does it primarily invoke? Demon, for example, borrows extensively from Espionage, Conspiracy Theories, and Gnosticism.</div> </div> </div> </div>At first it was demon summoners. Then it was time travelers. Then it became both demon summoners AND time travelers. Now we it is back to demon summoners.<br /> <br /> It does, however, invoke all kinds of themes about time travel, even though there is no (easy) time travel available- fate vs choice, determinism and probabilism, quantum mechanics, string theory, many worlds, timelines, higher dimensions, etc.<br /> <br /> Translating those scientific/sci fi terms into a fantasy frame is one of the challenges of the game. It took me 3-4 iterations just to generate a lexicon which I feel comfortable with. The main goal is doing so with the same elegance as it was done in Pandora Hearts, the Dragonlance Legends, the Deathgate Cycle and the Belgariad/Malloreon did. Not an easy task, but you need to aim to the moon if you wish to fall among the stars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-05T23:45:58-07:00","id":1243133,"title":"","content":"So, just wanted to ask those who read my blog what they prefer to see as my next blog post- something about Conjurer, the Fantasy Shard, Primitive Templates (for my Dark Era) or perhaps Inferno? (I'm working on my cosmology post, I promise you)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T03:18:15-07:00","id":1243162,"title":"","content":"Inferno for me. Better if you could sneak in references to nuking the place <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-07T19:12:38-07:00","id":1243677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1243162#post1243162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inferno for me. Better if you could sneak in references to nuking the place <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What he said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T09:47:46-07:00","id":1244529,"title":"","content":"And for this week, I present to you my blog post about<a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/08/10/chapter-31-fires-of-hell-infernal-splats/\" target=\"_blank\"> infernal splats</a>! Enjoy! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T14:55:18-07:00","id":1244629,"title":"","content":"Aww, no mention of the Possessed and the conflict between Inferno and the Abyss?<br /> <br /> Still don\u2019t agree on that Geist debate back there, but regardless, larval-Bound sound interesting. Sounds like Night Horrors material.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-11T00:36:54-07:00","id":1244746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1244629#post1244629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aww, no mention of the Possessed and the conflict between Inferno and the Abyss?</div> </div> </div> </div>As the Possessed are an infernal template, and the idea behind that post was creating infernal splat for non infernal templates, talking about them in the post felt a bit redundant. However, there is some &quot;Abyss vs Inferno&quot; thing going in Conjurer's section of the post (as the Shattered are an abyssal template). If I were to do an abyssal version of that post (that is, talking about potential abyssal splats), the possessed would likely appear in it (heck, I could do a God Machine/Underworld/Shadow/etc kind of post for all gamelines. Heck, we could even try to adapt a D&amp;D 4e kind of outlook where you have a &quot;power source&quot; and a &quot;monster type&quot; and see how the two mash together as some sort of an alternative setting).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-11T00:57:31-07:00","id":1244750,"title":"","content":"Oh, for some reason I thought your Conjurers weren\u2019t Abyssal any more. <br /> <br /> Anyways, a \u201cgrid\u201d sort where all Main Types get \u201ctainted\u201d by Ephemerals... that sounds fun <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> EDIT: Wait, iirc we had a Crossover Templates thread already. Maybe it\u2019s better placed there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":". 08-11-2018, 04:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-11T02:15:22-07:00","id":1244764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1244750#post1244750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">EDIT: Wait, iirc we had a Crossover Templates thread already. Maybe it\u2019s better placed there.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that the principle is similar, but the method is different.Instead of making a monster which is both a vampire and a werewolf, for example, you create a vampire which is powered by the spirit world and a werewolf which changed through the powers of Vitae. In that paradigm, for example, the Ulgan would be Shadow-powered Promethean, the Gangrel would be a Vitae based Werewolf, the Mekhet are Sekhem created Vampire, the Acanthus are Faerie birthed Mages, etc, etc. There could also be &quot;subtypes&quot; to allow greater diversity- for example, &quot;Sekhem&quot; would in fact be divided into &quot;Law&quot;, &quot;Will&quot;, &quot;Fate&quot;, &quot;Devourer&quot; and &quot;Life&quot;, with each attributing to a different splat. I think that suich an alternative system would be focused more around &quot;making your own monster&quot; kind of thing, than offering a complete set of monsters for each gameline. Just a thought experiment to think about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T07:39:04-07:00","id":1247015,"title":"","content":"And this week, I'm presenting to you the first post for my Shard- the <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/08/17/open-development-12-the-league-of-flouriey-the-city-states-rol/\" target=\"_blank\">city states which make the League of Flouriey</a>! Hope you'll like it, and if any of you feel inspired I would welcome any help in writing the rest of the setting! :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-18T09:24:47-07:00","id":1247411,"title":"","content":"Oh wow. Oh wow. Wow wow.<br /> <br /> I just stumbled across this, and it is a thing of beauty. I've just binged almost the whole thing. I really loved the in-depth and scientific look at Vampire and Werewolf, I hope you continue it sometime! Your cosmology is... really big and I am SO lost and oh Lord I'm going to have to bone up on my mythology. The First Temple Dark Era was great, really like the fact God is left as an open question and not defined in the text, that would be so stifling. Conjurer looks like fun, seeing the Abyss from another perspective, and the focus on time-travel themes. Hope I can throw my two cents in sometime.<br /> <br /> Edit: Cleaned it up a bit to break up the Great Wall of Text.<br /> Oh, and the templates! The ideas! I love the whole Fires of Hell post.<br /> <br /> Vampire: I'm rather partial to the proto-Daeva idea, I always liked the Hollow Mekhet. And while on the surface that would dilute the strix connection to them, if we go with multiple Daeva-like Clans coming up separately and later merging into one it can still work. Plus just the fact a genuinely diabolical undead just up and integrated with the rest of these posers probably stuck in their collective craw.<br /> <br /> Werewolf: The alternative First Change ideas look really good too, especially reworking the Balam Colop. Call me a cat person. Then again, demonic bulls changing Wolf-Blooded into more demonic bulls has a certain charm.<br /> <br /> Mage: The misguided semi-Goetic cult sounds really sweet, and brings to mind musings I've privately had on the possible effects having your Daemon (your Vice, right?) infected into a Deceptor, and then having a testament written about it so it becomes a Dominion. And then I thought &quot;What if a Scelestus Manifested an Acamoth and hot-swapped out his Daemon for it?&quot; I wonder what all this enthusiasm for the infernal, taking a hideously dangerous situation and having a Scelestus say &quot;I can do worse,&quot; and prove it by doing spiritual brain surgery on himself so he can cut away a piece of himself and graft in a piece of the Abyss that happens to be the right shape in its place, says about my state of mind? And my love of run-on sentences. Also I think having someone foretell of a time when someone of the suggested Proximi lineage will Awaken would be a cool plot hook.<br /> <br /> Promethean: The Sulfurous Refinement is everything I ever wanted from a Promethean antagonist and never knew how to ask for it. I'm guessing the Refinement is probably just as hard to leave as the Centimani, if not harder. The Baalim are great too. I hope the New Dawn is there for them, even if it does bite them in the ass like with the Zeke somehow (knowing demons, there's always a catch).<br /> <br /> Changeling: The Court of Hell I'm actually a little confused by, you said they're &quot;infiltrators and parasites&quot; who sell out their friends, but then you say the &quot;Freehold gets freedom,&quot; which implies it gets some benefit from this. Just to clarify, is the Freehold in fact safer from other threats with them around despite losing members quietly on the sly? If so it is rather diabolical, I must say. As for the infernal Seeming... wait what? Escape from actual Hell, but then get coaxed into returning of their own free will? That's just... well damn.<br /> <br /> Geist: This is a tough choice, but I'd probably go with the Krewe over the new Archetype if only to see how all the other Archetypes find their own ways to Hell. And I heartily approve of the Larvae Bound, I've never played Wraith, but I've heard good things about it and how Larvae Bound would probably work similarly.<br /> <br /> Mummy: Well played here, I would never have have thought of subverting the will of the Judges that way. There would probably need to be some research done, a ritual followed, a sacrifice made (but what is another sacrifice in the unlife of a guildmember of the Nameless Empire?) but in the end freedom and eternal life! Now if only the followers of your old Judge would either join you or leave you alone... hell I could see the Deceived taking exception to this (at least the Temakh). Oh, but then we have a choice, Twice Arisen or variant? I lean more towards Twice Arisen if only because other Rites are just... meh.<br /> <br /> Demon: The Unchained Hellfire Club gets my vote, unless inspiration strikes and you can work out a different theme to work the Satanic Agenda. I also agree, forcing a Fall doesn't sit well for me. You mentioned in your nitty-gritty post of the Core mechanics on ephemerals that while angels have human-like minds with Virtue and Vice, the lack of Integrity points to them being naturally soulless. Actually makes me wonder if them gaining a &quot;soul&quot; would just naturally flip the Virtue and Vice automatically without any further input. Anyways giving the Exiles more love sounds good to me. Wait...<br /> <br /> Beasts: I'm a bit out of touch, I thought they form Hives? But if there aren't any mechanics to hang infernal forbidden fruit off of, Kinship and a Malus Loci for a Den sound excellent. And yes a variant would probably work better than a Family. Horrors may be ephemera of the Astral, but they just don't seem to have anything for the Inferno to latch on to so it can infect them. They are too pure in their expression of primordial fear for something like sin to contaminate them. Unlike spirits which are built to literally be what they eat, or how goetics can be ideas about sin, and ghosts (as with all people) are subject to temptation. In fact, for a corrupted Beast to even work, in order for them to feed they'd have to not only terrorize people, but somehow set it up so their victim sins in their terror? I thought Jigsaw was more of a Slasher than a Beast (and I'll end it there, this is not a place for me to vent about the Saw series). Also Yozis totally rule, Celebrants rock on!<br /> <br /> So anyway, like it, hope to see the Darkness of the Abyss version sometime!<br /> <br /> Edit: Demons tempting the Conjurers? The Abyss's true representatives among mortals getting tainted by the Inferno? I'll get the popcorn!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5467-kagemcs","user":"KageMCS","date":". 08-18-2018, 10:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5467-kagemcs","name":"KageMCS","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T07:11:21-07:00","id":1247688,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the kind words, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5467-kagemcs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5467\" data-vbnamecard=\"5467\">KageMCS</a>! I put a lot of work in my blog, so I'm happy to hear when people like my writings and ideas <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As for the &quot;Infernal Court&quot;, the Freehold in question is the court itself (it is a &quot;one court Freehold&quot; kinds of thing), and I am seriously considering on making the &quot;infernal conjurers&quot; a &quot;core-book&quot; antagonist for the game. I'll try to make the Abyss version of the post sometime soon! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T11:10:34-07:00","id":1252288,"title":"","content":"And after a long break (mostly to blame for me working on a 5e adventure for my friends), I'm happy to present to you a new interview- and this time, the <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/09/07/word-from-our-sponsors-4-the-lie/\" target=\"_blank\">Exarchs</a>!.. kinda. You'll see. Hope you'll like it! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-03T07:14:02-07:00","id":1258731,"title":"","content":"You know, now that I've been reminded Sophia is &quot;up there,&quot; I just realized that no matter what is going on, there is a hierarchy to the Supernal. And I just don't see that flying with the Libertines. So for the Council of Free Assemblies to truly succeed in their metaphysical goals, they can't just overthrow the Exarchs. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> They need to also somehow overthrow Sophia, and replace her with... what exactly? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> A set of representatives, perhaps one for each Arcana and one for the Abyss? Gee, wonder what might become of that? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> If they spot the problem with that, I suppose there's always the Tyranny of the Mob, which brings to mind the &quot;consensual reality&quot; of Ascension. There weren't any problems with that, right? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5467-kagemcs","name":"KageMCS","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-22T18:38:34-07:00","id":1262267,"title":"","content":"Lost,you are going to and your third cosmology post any time soon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T07:13:03-07:00","id":1262353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1262267#post1262267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lost,you are going to and your third cosmology post any time soon?</div> </div> </div> </div>I certainly hope I would- it is in my &quot;to do&quot; list for ages, but I've had to finish my Master's proposal for the university and develop a D&amp;D adventure for my friends as their DM, so it kinda consumed my time. I hope that I'll have the time to finish the cosmology project soon, but I can't promise yet :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-01T14:23:18-07:00","id":1264114,"title":"","content":"And after a long, <i>long</i> absence, I've decided to share with you some of the <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/11/01/chapter-32-secrets-of-the-conspiracy-hunter-homebrew-the-truth-pt-1/\" target=\"_blank\">truth behind my conspiracies</a>. Hope you'll like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-16T03:02:18-08:00","id":1267793,"title":"","content":"And this time, I prove in this blog a short review of Night Horrors: the Tormented, as well as an<a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/11/16/chapter-33-engines-of-fire-ash-and-ice-the-jovian-and-promethean-cosmology/\" target=\"_blank\"> in depth investigation of the Jovian</a> and its place in my homebrew CofD cosmolgy. Hope you'll like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-20T14:16:46-08:00","id":1269353,"title":"","content":"I'm rereading the cosmologynposts because I love them. And I gotta some new questions <br /> What are cofd imbued like?<br /> what the wendigo phone is a patron of like?<br /> What are Or Ein* Soph Saints like?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-21T14:15:04-08:00","id":1269657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1269353#post1269353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm rereading the cosmologynposts because I love them. And I gotta some new questions<br /> What are cofd imbued like?<br /> what the wendigo phone is a patron of like?<br /> What are Or Ein* Soph Saints like?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Imbued are more or less the same beings they were in CWoD- people who were granted with strange powers from stranger beings in order to fight monsters and other terrors of the night. They treat hunters as &quot;bystanders&quot;- that is, people who know about the darkness, but haven't made the needed sacrifice to become agents of those mysterious, higher powers. What that&quot;sacrifice&quot; actually means is less defined right now, but it would be a certain lose of humanity, and swearing their Creed.<br /> <br /> The Wendigo are the children of Deer, the Great Prey, the counterpart of the Great Predator during the time of Pangaea. With their control over Life and Death, Deer was repeatedly hunted and reborn by Wolf, and with each of their deaths some of its Essence was left behind, creating strange, horned shapeshifters. However, when Wolf died, the cycle was broken, and the were-deer went out of balance, with the prey becoming the predators and madness taking over those which held the old blood of the Horned One.<br /> <br /> Finally, Saints are meant to be the CofD's Solar Exalts- they are a form of variant mages, Awakened not to the realms of the Supernal but as messengers and prophets of the Powers that Be. Their &quot;Awakening&quot; is always a religious experience, as a certain godlike power reveals itself to them and leads their souls to higher dimensions. Each Saint is based around a single Arcana, which they then manipulate through their skills in order to unlock a variety of effects. The concept is still rough, but I do plan on polishing it and publishing it through the STV when the time would come.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-21T14:25:39-08:00","id":1269664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1269657#post1269657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Imbued are more or less the same beings they were in CWoD- people who were granted with strange powers from stranger beings in order to fight monsters and other terrors of the night. They treat hunters as &quot;bystanders&quot;- that is, people who know about the darkness, but haven't made the needed sacrifice to become agents of those mysterious, higher powers. What that&quot;sacrifice&quot; actually means is less defined right now, but it would be a certain lose of humanity, and swearing their Creed.<br /> <br /> The Wendigo are the children of Deer, the Great Prey, the counterpart of the Great Predator during the time of Pangaea. With their control over Life and Death, Deer was repeatedly hunted and reborn by Wolf, and with each of their deaths some of its Essence was left behind, creating strange, horned shapeshifters. However, when Wolf died, the cycle was broken, and the were-deer went out of balance, with the prey becoming the predators and madness taking over those which held the old blood of the Horned One.<br /> <br /> Finally, Saints are meant to be the CofD's Solar Exalts- they are a form of variant mages, Awakened not to the realms of the Supernal but as messengers and prophets of the Powers that Be. Their &quot;Awakening&quot; is always a religious experience, as a certain godlike power reveals itself to them and leads their souls to higher dimensions. Each Saint is based around a single Arcana, which they then manipulate through their skills in order to unlock a variety of effects. The concept is still rough, but I do plan on polishing it and publishing it through the STV when the time would come.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm,do Saints have any relationships with Prometheans? Cause Or Ein Soph is ultimately the source of Prometheans two right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-21T14:33:58-08:00","id":1269665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1269664#post1269664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm,do Saints have any relationships with Prometheans? Cause Or Ein Soph is ultimately the source of Prometheans two right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really- Ein Soph is, more or less, the origin of <i>everything</i>. It is just that Ahura Mazda, or the Principle, is closer to the origin than most of the other Powers that Be. More than that, Ein Soph describes an unmovable object- an unmoved mover- and the Saints are born from its refined light. The Principle is the edge where reality spins around that solid point of light and burn by the touch of divinity- it is the movement of the universe, which is close to the First Light but still different from it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-24T03:20:52-08:00","id":1270298,"title":"","content":"And this week, I'm happy to present you with a bunch of concepts for new <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/11/24/chapter-34-hell-is-empty-all-devils-are-here-strains-of-the-cursed-blood/\" target=\"_blank\">Strains of Cursed Blood</a>! Give it a look, and feel free to give suggestions about those concepts and which you would like to see in more depth!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-24T11:14:31-08:00","id":1270381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1270298#post1270298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And this week, I'm happy to present you with a bunch of concepts for new <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/2018/11/24/chapter-34-hell-is-empty-all-devils-are-here-strains-of-the-cursed-blood/\" target=\"_blank\">Strains of Cursed Blood</a>! Give it a look, and feel free to give suggestions about those concepts and which you would like to see in more depth!</div> </div> </div> </div>For Promethean,how bout some demonic clones? Think of it that wag,the clones are made of Azoth,but some are mixed with the DNA of other beings,what if someone tries to create a clone using the genetic material of a demon? The corrupting demonic forces tainting the globe's azoth,turning it into something new,something even worse than Flux?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-27T11:52:33-08:00","id":1271207,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1270381#post1270381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For Promethean,how bout some demonic clones? Think of it that wag,the clones are made of Azoth,but some are mixed with the DNA of other beings,what if someone tries to create a clone using the genetic material of a demon? The corrupting demonic forces tainting the globe's azoth,turning it into something new,something even worse than Flux?</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds more or less like what I had in mind for a Baalim connected strain, even though I haven't thought about using clones as a baseline. Interesting suggestion. I think it has some great potential.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I gives an heads up that I won't make a new blog post this week due to me needing to make some adjustment to my player's d&amp;d adventure, as well as investing my time at writing the first draft for a Shard which I plan on publishing in the STV. I think I like how it comes out right now, so let's see how it rolls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T21:04:39-08:00","id":1278760,"title":"","content":"Lost,are you pllaning on doing the third cosmology post Anytime soon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-08T12:29:32-07:00","id":1492620,"title":"","content":"Is the cofd consensus equal to the one in the wod?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24222-acopiltaczet","name":"Acopiltaczet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24222_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-08T12:35:57-07:00","id":1492621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acopiltaczet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1103498-my-cofd-blog?p=1492620#post1492620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is the cofd consensus equal to the one in the wod?</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're talking about the popular opinion about Chronicles versus World, no-people regard the games very differently.<br /> <br /> If you're talking about the metaphysical concept, no-Consensus is not a metaphysical force/property of Chronicles-that's a strictly World concept.<br /> <br /> EDIT: also, I just noticed the necromancy. In future, Ask A Simple Question threads will be the best place to drop questions like this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-08T17:47:44-07:00","id":1492649,"title":"","content":"All righty","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24222-acopiltaczet","name":"Acopiltaczet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24222_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}